  "modules": [
    {
      "id": "uniequip_001_totter",
      "name": {
        "en": "Totter's Badge",
        "zh": "铅踝证章",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "INITIAL",
      "typeName2": "",
      "icon": "uniequip_001_totter",
      "description": {
        "en": "Operator Totter has demonstrated a remarkable aptitude for maintaining distance whilst conducting suppressive fire against enemies of heavy caliber.\nThe Field Operations Department has thus passed the following resolution:\nThis operator shall be appointed a Sniper Operator during field operations to exercise Besieger responsibilities.\nIn witness whereof,\nThis badge is hereby conferred upon the above named.",
        "zh": "干员铅踝擅长保持距离对重型敌人进行火力压制\n根据外勤部门决议\n在外勤任务中划分为狙击干员，行使攻城手职责\n特别颁发此证章\n以兹证明",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "uniequip_002_totter",
      "name": {
        "en": "Snow Globe",
        "zh": "雪花球",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "ADVANCED",
      "typeName2": "X",
      "icon": "uniequip_002_totter",
      "description": {
        "en": "'I should get out of here,'\nHe said, bowing his head as he wrapped the arrowhead tightly with twine.\n'A few days ago, a group of mercenaries passed by. They were in need of an archer, and I believe I can fill that role.\n'We'll be traveling through a vast desert, then on through layers of towering forest, and ultimately arrive at a northern city.\n'It's a snowy place, and even wearing several layers, you'll still shiver from that winter cold.\n'I can make new friends there, and save enough money to buy a huge house to share with my loved ones.\n'I should get out of here. It's too hot, everyone's always sweating.\n'Life's pretty boring, too. The only thing there is to do is chase the animals around every day.\n'I believe I'm meant for more. What do you think?'\nHe swung the arrow a few times before nocking it gently into the bow.\nThe arrow flew off into the distance, beyond the reach of his sight.\n\n'You should get out of here,'\nHe bowed his head and refused to answer as he continued chopping wood with his axe.\n'In a few days, a group of mercenaries will come, and they are in need an archer. I think you're perfect for the job.\n'You'll travel through a vast forest, traverse fields of waving wheat, and ultimately arrive at a small town in the south.\n'It rarely snows there, and the trees stay green, even in winter. It's warm enough wear only a single layer of clothing.\n'You'll make new friends there, save some money, and maybe even find a lady to spend your life with.\n'You shouldn't stay here. It's too cold, and snowstorms come in the winter.\n'Look around you. There's nothing to do here. The only thing that comes close is hunting.\n'I believe you're meant for more. What do you think?'\nHe weighed the axe in his hand and carefully placed it atop the pile of wood. He remained silent and merely rubbed his teeth against his lip. He kept at it for a while, enjoying the sweet, tangy taste in his mouth.\nFinally, he spoke.\n'No, I'm fine here. I should stay.'\n'What are you even staying for?'\n'I'm waiting.'\n'For what?'\nHe fell silent again. He had no answer to this question.\nFor the storms to subside? For the snow to melt?\nOr maybe only for an arrow, shot by a young boy, to break the bounds of time and space, with the courage of ignorance and naive bravado, tearing through the layers of his life's disguises, to pierce his very heart.\nThen, his heart would shatter, only to light up once more, filled with warmth anew.",
        "zh": "“我应该离开这里。”\n他低着头，用一卷卷麻绳把箭头绑好。\n“几天前有一队佣兵路过，他们缺一个弓箭手，我觉得自己可以补上这个位置。\n“我们会穿越一大片沙漠，路过一些层层叠叠的树林，最终抵达一座北方的城市。\n“那是个会下雪的地方，在冬天即使穿了好几层衣服，人也会冻得浑身发抖。\n“在那里我可以结识新的朋友，攒足够的钱，买一幢巨大的房子，里面住着我和我爱的人。\n“我不应该在这里，这里太热了，人永远汗津津的。\n“生活也很无聊，每天唯一能做的事就是追着动物的屁股跑。\n“我觉得我能做的事情不止这些，你说呢？”\n提着箭支甩过几下，他确认箭头绑得很结实，于是轻轻搭在弓上。\n箭支射向视线无法捕获的远方，不知所终。\n\n“你应该离开这里。”\n他低着头不愿回答，手中的斧头不停，很快木柴堆成一座小山。\n“几天后有一队佣兵要来，他们缺一个弓箭手，我觉得你很适合。\n“行进途中你们需要穿越一片辽阔的树林，路过一些泛着波浪的麦田，最后抵达一座南方的小镇。\n“那里很少下雪，冬天树叶依然常绿，穿着单衣也足够暖和。\n“在那里你会认识几个新朋友，攒点小钱，或许还能找到一位女士，愿意陪伴你度过余生。\n“你不应该在这里，太冷了，一到冬天就刮雪暴。\n“看看这四周，荒无人烟，能有什么乐子？稍微还能有点意思的事就只有打打猎。\n“我觉得你能做的事情远超这些，你说呢？”\n他掂掂斧子，轻轻把它放在柴堆最上层，仍然不发一语，只是用牙齿轻轻蹭着唇沿。许久，他在唇齿间尝到了甜腥味。\n终于，他回复。\n“不，我在这里挺好，我应该留在这里。”\n“你留在这里干什么呢？”\n“等等看。”\n“等什么？”\n他再次沉默，这个问题他答不上来。\n等风暴停息？等冰雪融化？\n又或者，只是等一支少年时射出的长箭，冲破时间与空间的封锁，挟带着无知的勇气与天真的豪言，撕裂生活层层的伪装，击中心脏。\n那一刻，他的心将破碎裂开，然后，重新被点亮，再次有温度。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ],
